## TRUE  = symmetric-log axis, matching the panel in the workbook.
## FALSE = plain log10 axis. Preferable for BAFF: the symlog scale exists only to
##         give a value of 0 somewhere to sit, and BAFF has no zeros, so it just
##         spends the lower half of the panel on empty space between 0 and the
##         lowest measurement (137 pg/mL). See the note at the foot of the file.
